@startuml
start
:Patient enters natural language question;
:Filter & anonymize payload (Strip PII - NFR-03);
:Query Vector DB for relevant leaflet chunks (FR-09);

if (Relevant leaflet chunks found?) then (yes)
  :Construct prompt with context & official leaflet text;
  :Send request to External LLM API;
  
  if (LLM response status?) then (200 OK)
    :Extract answer & exact section citation (FR-10);
    :Render answer with source link on Chat UI;
  else (HTTP 429 Rate Limit Error - NFR-02)
    :Catch 429 error gracefully;
    :Display "API limit reached. Please try again later." message;
  endif

else (no)
  :Display "Information not found in official leaflets" warning;
endif

stop
@enduml